      "<span style=\"color:#a4c2f4\"><b>Breaker Effects</b></span> <span style=\"color:#cccccc\"><b>have altered their passive effects since MoT.</b></span>",
      "",
      "<span style=\"color:#f9cb9c\"><b>Shield-Piercing</b></span> <span style=\"color:#cccccc\"><b>can go through PHYSICAL BARRIERS.</b></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#cccccc\"><i>(Bucklers, Hydra Barriers, etc)</i></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#ea9999\"><b>Still deals more damage to Barricades.</b></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#e06666\"><b>No longer overpenetrates enemies.</b></span>",
      "",
      "<span style=\"color:#b4a7d6\"><b>Overload's Disruption</b></span> <span style=\"color:#cccccc\"><b>counts as</b></span> <span style=\"color:#dd7e6b\"><b>Exhaust</b></span> <span style=\"color:#cccccc\"><b>only for the purpose of</b></span> <span style=\"color:#89cdd1\"><b>Photonic Flare</b></span> <span style=\"color:#cccccc\"><b>and</b></span> <span style=\"color:#d5a6bd\"><b>Elemental</b></span> <span style=\"color:#ffd966\"><b>Supercharger</b></span> <span style=\"color:#63d275\"><i>(Tablet Artifact)</i></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#cccccc\"><b>It still lowers</b></span> <span style=\"color:#ea9999\"><b>Guardian</b></span> <span style=\"color:#d5a6bd\"><b>Energy Regen</b></span> <span style=\"color:#cccccc\"><b>to 0.4x.</b></span>",
      "",
      "<span style=\"color:#dd7e6b\"><b>Exhaust-specific effects</b></span> <span style=\"color:#cccccc\"><i><small>(Psychohack, Problem Solver, etc)</small></i></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#a4c2f4\"><b>Decrease Combatant Damage by 25%</b></span><span style=\"color:#cccccc\"><b>.</b></span>",
      "",
      "<span style=\"color:#dd7e6b\"><b>Unstoppable</b></span> <span style=\"color:#cccccc\"><b>has increased stagger.</b></span>",
      "<span style=\"color:#cc0000\"><b>Galvanized 2</b></span> <span style=\"color:#cccccc\"><b>= ONLY Unstoppables can stagger.</b></span>"
    ]
